"description": "SiriusXM Holdings, Inc. engages in the provision of audio entertainment. It operates through the Sirius XM and Pandora and Off-Platform segments. The Sirius XM segment features a wide range of content, including, music, sports, entertainment, comedy, talk and news channels, podcasts and infotainment services, all available in the United States on a subscription fee basis. The Pandora and Off-Platform segment generates a majority of its revenues from third parties advertising on the Pandora ad-supported service and other platforms. The company was founded on May 17, 1990, and is headquartered in New York, NY.",
